    <figcaption>The three attempts at the certificate tax, at their true relative speeds: a browser session
    per document (~18/minute), a native PHP engine (~128/minute) — and finally no render at all unless a
    user asks for the document. The fastest PDF is the one you never generate.</figcaption>
