  <div class="metric">
    <span class="tag">The result</span>
    The certificate cost on the pipeline dropped to effectively <strong>zero seconds per step</strong> —
    you can see it in any order today, where Borrower Ownership and Murabaha Completed finish in
    <strong>0 seconds</strong> (the live order in Part&nbsp;1 shows exactly this). When someone does request
    a certificate, it renders in about 3 seconds at seven times the old throughput. At 5,000 orders and five
    certificates each, the on-demand decision removed tens of thousands of renders from every test run —
    the largest single time sink we ever took off the critical path. And it came out of a business
    conversation, not a profiler.
  </div>
</section>


